  "body": "MACLEANS COLLEGE | BUCKLANDS BEACH INTERMEDIATE | BUCKLANDS BEACH PRIMARY SCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nA home where practical design meets modern comfort.\r\n\r\nThe way a home is arranged can make all the difference to everyday living.\r\n\r\nAt 45B Hattaway Avenue, the separate kitchen creates a dedicated cooking space, while the adjoining living and dining areas provide a comfortable setting for relaxing and spending time together.\r\n\r\nThis brand-new home offers three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and the convenience of an internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom features an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, complemented by two further bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFeatures to appreciate:\r\n• Title and CCC issued\r\n• Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n•  Separate kitchen\r\n•  Comfortable living and dining areas\r\n•  Master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n•  Internal-access single garage\r\n•  Private, fenced outdoor area\r\n•  Brand-new, easy-care construction\r\n\r\nSituated in an established Bucklands Beach neighbourhood, the home offers convenient access to local amenities and the Eastern Beaches lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPractical design, modern finishes and a location worth considering.",
